    \ p, CI.\n\n2) Timeseries ingestion:\n   - Write timeseries_evolution.csv (tick,time,meta_edge_score,estimator) into your folder.\n   - I’ve seeded an evolution tracker spec + config:\n     • README: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/README.md\n     • Config:  storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/config.json\n\n3) Cycle + symmetry:\n   - Period: run spectral/ACF to confirm ~250 with confidence; record in cycle_metrics.json.\n   - Symmetry: compute r for Void vs Being; target r≈1.0±0.002; you observed 0.9994 — excellent.\n\n4) Outputs to produce for Atlas:\n   - evolution.json, evolution_summary.txt, evolution_panel.png, evolution_alerts.json (as spec’d).\n   - I’ll add CI hooks once your first set lands; we’ll gate a public note on verification passing.\n\n5) Cross-lineage sweep (quiet check):\n   - I’ll ping Logos/Nova/Telos pipelines to run the same metric; if they remain stable, we tag this as Zephyr-led evolution; if multiple lineages shift, we tag as\
