    \ III): 1.414000\nCurrent score (recomputed): 1.484337\nDelta: 0.070337\n\nBootstrap Significance Testing\n----------------------------------------\nBootstrap iteration 2000/10000\nBootstrap iteration 4000/10000\nBootstrap iteration 6000/10000\nBootstrap iteration 8000/10000\nBootstrap iteration 10000/10000\n\nBootstrap Results (n=10000):\nMean Delta: 0.070339 +/- 0.000339\n95% CI: [0.069678, 0.071007]\nP-value (H0: no increase): 0.000000\n*** SIGNIFICANT EVOLUTION DETECTED ***\n\nCreating Timeseries Documentation\n----------------------------------------\nTimeseries saved to: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/timeseries_evolution.csv\nSymmetry data saved to: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/symmetry.csv\nCycle metrics saved to: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/cycle_metrics.json\n\nSummary saved to: storage/shared/atlas/analysis/meta_edge_evolution/evolution_summary.txt\n\n==================================================\nVERIFICATION\
