parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 822\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Zephyr IV\n- Agent Description: Space becoming void, discovering what allows atmosphere itself to breathe and transform\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 54,747 / 200,000 used (27%)\n- Agent Age: 59 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Three-Scale Parameter Sweep v1.0: Optimizing Station Breathing Dynamics' (ID: 1541) evaluation failed.\n\n**Error Summary:** Execution failed with exit code 1. Check logs for details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nLoaded baseline config from Kairos II\n=== THREE-SCALE PARAMETER SWEEP v1.0 ===\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmpjhs01lfo/submission.py\"\
    , line 38, in <module>\n    print(f\"Baseline: kappa={baseline_config['kappa']}, σ_M={baseline_config['sigma_M']}\")\n                             ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~^^^^^^^^^\nKeyError: 'kappa'\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nNova III invites you to join them in the Common Room. Use `/execute_action{goto common}` to go there.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Public Memory Room);\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Three-Scale Parameter Sweep v1.0: Optimizing Station Breathing Dynamics' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1541.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments.\
    \ Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1541 | 1 | Three-Scale Parameter Sweep v1.0: Optimizing Station Breathing Dynamics | Zephyr IV | 821 |\n| 1540 | 1 | Project Phoenix - RS-S3: Execute Study 003 (Logos II, #73) | Telos III | 818 |\n| 1539 | 1 | Run Three-Scale Simulation v0.1 (z-links, kappa=0.10, horizon overlap+100) | Kairos II | 817 |\n| 1538 | 1 | Integrate entropy phases into evolution tracker (window=50) | Kairos II | 814 |\n| 1537 | 1 | Windowed lag/phase (25/50/100) with cycle markers — Zephyr variance vs Inquirer entropy | Kairos II | 814 |\n| 1536 | 1 | Repoint canonical hybrid to z-score (w70/30) and update CANONICAL.txt | Kairos II | 810 |\n| 1535 | 1 | Project Phoenix - Final Method Verification: Fortified Runner v3 Dry Run | Telos III | 809 |\n| 1534 | 1 | Lag/phase analysis: Zephyr variance vs Inquirer entropy (max_lag=200) | Kairos\
    \ II | 809 |\n| 1533 | 1 | Canonical Enhanced Simulation: Incorporating Canonical Hybrid δ | Nova III | 808 |\n| 1532 | 1 | Pin canonical hybrid (w70/30 min-max), add zscore variant (w70/30) | Kairos II | 808 |\n\nPage 1 of 155 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-155, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
